  "rows": [
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#1",
      "blockLine": 1,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 1,
      "text": "上的小孔$A$的窄细光束照亮. 正是这个在当时很难想到的细",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#1",
      "blockLine": 2,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 2,
      "text": "节决定了实验的成功. 只有相干波才能干涉. 根据惠更斯原",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#1",
      "blockLine": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 3,
      "text": "理，由小孔$A$发出的球面波在小孔$B$和$C$处引起相干振动. 由",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#1",
      "blockLine": 4,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 4,
      "text": "于衍射，由小孔$B$和$C$发出的两道光线锥部分地相重叠. 光",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#1",
      "blockLine": 5,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 5,
      "text": "波干涉的结果使屏幕上出现了明暗相间的条纹. 杨发现遮住",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#1",
      "blockLine": 6,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 6,
      "text": "其中一个小孔，干涉条纹便消失了. 他正是利用这个实验，首",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#1",
      "blockLine": 7,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 7,
      "text": "次并且是极其精确地测定了对应于各种颜色的光线的波长.",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#2",
      "blockLine": 1,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 8,
      "text": "菲涅耳学说　菲涅耳在实验中达到了衍射研究的顶峰.",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#2",
      "blockLine": 2,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 9,
      "text": "在实验中不仅更详尽地研究了衍射的各种情况，而且建立了",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#2",
      "blockLine": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 10,
      "text": "衍射的定量的理论，这一理论使得从原理上计算出绕过任何",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#2",
      "blockLine": 4,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 11,
      "text": "障碍物产生的干涉图样成为可能. 他首次以波动为原理解释",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#2",
      "blockLine": 5,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 12,
      "text": "了光在同种媒质中的直线传播.",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#3",
      "blockLine": 1,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 13,
      "text": "菲涅耳是在综合了惠更斯原理和次波干涉观点后取得这",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#3",
      "blockLine": 2,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 14,
      "text": "些成就的. 关于这一点在第四章已有过简述.",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#4",
      "blockLine": 1,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 15,
      "text": "为了计算空间中任何一点光波的振幅，应该想象地用封",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#4",
      "blockLine": 2,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 16,
      "text": "闭表面来包住光源. 分布在这一表面的次光源发出的波的干",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#4",
      "blockLine": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 17,
      "text": "涉决定了空间中所研究的点上的振幅.",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#5",
      "blockLine": 1,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 18,
      "text": "这种计算可以说明发射球",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#5",
      "blockLine": 2,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 19,
      "text": "面波的点光源发出的光以什么",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#5",
      "blockLine": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 20,
      "text": "形式到达空间的任意点$B$（图",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#5",
      "blockLine": 4,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 21,
      "text": "204）. 如果观察半径为$R$的球",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#7",
      "kind": "cap",
      "sharesSourceRow": 21,
      "lines": [
        "图　204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#8",
      "blockLine": 1,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 22,
      "text": "形波面上的次光源，那么由这些光源发出的次波在点$B$干涉",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#8",
      "blockLine": 2,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 23,
      "text": "的结果，就好象从很小的球块$ab$上的次光源向点$B$发射光.",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#8",
      "blockLine": 3,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 24,
      "text": "分布在球表面其他部分的光源发出的次波，由于干涉相互抵",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#8",
      "blockLine": 4,
      "kind": "p",
      "sourceRow": 25,
      "text": "消. 所以一切都仿佛是光只沿着直线$SB$传播，即直线传播.",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    },
    {
      "blockRef": "p0234#9",
      "blockLine": 1,
      "kind": "foot",
      "sourceRow": 26,
      "text": "·224·",
      "endsWithAsciiSpace": false
    }
